          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تلفاز (tilfāz) is a modern word borrowed from European television and fitted to an Arabic pattern; it has no Arabic root."
            }
